          "reasons": [
           {
            "@type": "meaningComprehension",
            "comprehends": [
             "copies/pd354nj6106#inscription"
            ],
            "note": "No date was read in it, so its figures were not graded. Ink, bass edge. Roll number 1454 plain, and confirmed by the printed leader label in crop 4 (Welte-Mignon No. 1454, 'God save the King'). A five-figure date group follows: the first two read 24 and the last reads 9, but the three middle figures are broken and not separable at this resolution, so no date is given. A cursive signature follows the date; possibly beginning Sch-, but not legible enough to name."
           }
          ]
         }
        }
       },
       "medium": "ink"
      }
     ],
